@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}
<div class="card stack">
    <h1>Privacy at the counter</h1>
    <p>Identity document numbers are reduced to their last four characters the moment they are entered; the full number is never stored, logged or audited.</p>
    <p>The audit log records which staff member performed an action, at which branch and when. It never contains passwords, document numbers, API keys or card data.</p>
</div>
